    "body": "Removed the generated Notes filler. Ordinary non-integrated rows now leave Notes blank because the red X already shows their status. Notes remain only for useful limits, risks, dependencies, edit scope, or why support is partial or unavailable.\n\nVisible check: open RDR2 Data Map and search for `conditionalanims` or `speechcontextrulesets`. Their Notes cells are blank. Rows with real context, such as partial catalog support or map-asset requirements, still show that context.",
